  "sourceTitle": "Lasagna Filling",
  "sourceText": "Lasagna Filling\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 4:59pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cans (8oz each) tomato sauce\n1 Clove garlic\n1 teaspoon Fresh oregano or\nteaspoon Dried oregano\n1 pkt Chopped frozen spinach\n1 cup Shreaded carrot\n7 ounces Ricotta cheese\n100 grams Yogurt lowfat\ncup Grated parmesan cheese\n1 cup Shreaded part skim mozarell`\npkt Frozen peas\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together in a large bowl. If making lasagna also need 9 lasagna noodles undercooked slightly. Layer like usual. Bake at 350F for 45 min then let cool on wire rack for about 15 min.",
